Package: eivGP
Title: Gaussian Process Regression with Ordinal Mixed Inputs
Version: 0.4.0.9007
Authors@R: c( person("Penghui", "Fu", role = "aut"), person("Xinye",
        "Chen", role = "aut"), person("Jianhua Z.", "Huang", role =
        "aut"), person("Sheng", "Jiang", , "jiangsheng@cuhk.edu.cn",
        role = c("aut", "cre")) )
Description: Fits errors-in-variables Gaussian process regressions with
        numeric predictors, ordinal proxies, and optional calibration
        measurements. Uses collapsed variance inference, a finite
        latent-length dictionary, and no-thinning elliptical slice
        sampling. Supports posterior prediction, latent-input
        imputation, diagnostics, and continuation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, dplyr, tidyr, ggplot2, knitr, patchwork, methods, parallel, posterior, stats, tools, TruncatedNormal,
        utils
Suggests: digest, rmarkdown, EzGP, kergp, LVGP, testthat
Encoding: UTF-8
